  "created": "2026-09-29T06:02:57.06Z",
  "description": "Platform MCP stdio server (ironbrain-mcp) for Cursor and other bots.\n      Authenticates as an Ironbrain account (Supabase JWT) and enqueues HITL Outbox actions\n      via Ironbrain.Api — bots never hold IMAP/SMTP adapter secrets.\n      Distinct from Ironbrain.MailCal.Mcp (local mail/calendar extract).",
  "id": "Ironbrain.Mcp",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-29T06:08:48.22Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "ys246zHSEOBQ7i+cMfSH62mtB5VIZC6Utykw4P/902AtIWdznz1aTw8GA/cjKCGihFv8sLpDVWW7UuY3wpKWJg==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 1447108,
  "projectUrl": "https://www.ironbrain.de/",
  "published": "2026-09-29T06:02:57.06Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0 — MailCal platform parity catch-up (tools already on main; package version lag).\nAdds / documents full tool surface: list_emails, get_email, list_calendars, list_appointments,\nenqueue_send_email, enqueue_move_email, enqueue_archive_email, enqueue_reply_email,\nenqueue_add_appointment, list_available_actions, list_pending_actions, whoami\n(plus opt-in confirm_action). Calendar reads require calendarId per calendar when multi-cal\n(no silent all-calendar aggregate). whoami now returns structured auth/connection errors.\ntools/list confirm-gate fails open on capabilities probe errors (hides confirm_action).\nPublish via CI Trusted Publishing (.github/workflows/publish-ironbrain-mcp.yml).\nInstall/update: dotnet tool install -g Ironbrain.Mcp / dotnet tool update -g Ironbrain.Mcp.",
